    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">Give your children the keys to winning in life! You&apos;ve heard it said, &quot;Attitude is Everything.&quot; Trees of the Spirit will introduce your children to nine character traits that will help them thrive. Love, joy, peace, patience, kindness, goodness, faith, meekness, and self-control! In this wonderfully illustrated story, children can learn about nine fundamental values to help tackle life&apos;s ups and downs in a positive way. Using a delightful mix of rhyme and flow, Trees of the Spirit provides children a unique learning experience that helps develop character and promote unity</marc:subfield>
    </marc:datafield>
